      "markdown": "",
      "displayCode": {
        "c": "char *f(char *s) {\n   int i, n, x;\n   char *s2;\n   n = strlen(s);\n   /* allocate n bytes of memory for s2 */\n   s2 = (char *) malloc(n);\n   for (i = 0; i < n; ++i ) {\n      x = s[i] - 'a';\n      s2[i] = ((x + 13) % 26) + 'a';\n   }\n   return s2;\n}"
